title: Our three practices move and mend; none checks a note against its source, reads across graphs, mines the transcripts for what went wrong, or tests a doubt.
pid: e51b7f29-0ef3-469e-94a3-e2569f43b0ac
body: |2-
  The three: Top's tending after each mission (general up, particular
  behind a link, what Git records deleted); Libby, who took it over
  on 2026-11-13; and a waking mind mending what tripped it.
  What they already do as the evidence advises (inferred, from the
  record of tending in the team note): they move far more than they
  rewrite, which is ACE's remedy; Top commits a graph as its specialist
  left it before tending, so the raw version is kept, as Anthropic's
  dreams never change their input and the faulty-memory paper keeps
  raw episodes; and Top waited for "three cases" before naming a pattern.
  What the published work does that they do not:
  - Check a note against what it came from. Jeff's own definition of
    dreaming has "checking against the transcript"; Anthropic's dream
    verifies. Tending has corrected only what had gone out of date,
    never against a source, and a waking mind
    mends only what trips it, so a wrong note that reads smoothly stays.
  - Read across graphs. Anthropic's dreaming looks across agents for a
    mistake made twice or a preference all share. Tending reads one
    graph after one mission; carrying Drew's answer back to Tay is the
    one time it crossed.
  - Mine the transcripts. A specialist writes what it learned; what
    went wrong, the detour, mostly stays in the transcript, and
    ReasoningBank found lessons from failures worth keeping beside
    those from successes. The transcripts are kept; Scarlett's account
    already reads them.
  - Find what is stale or contradicted: the weakest ability of every
    memory tested (MemoryAgentBench). Top's search for "until", "still"
    and "next" is a start; claims carrying a date are not swept.
  - Test a hypothesis. Jeff's definition has it; graphs here keep doubts
    with the smallest trial that would settle each, mine among them,
    and nothing schedules the trials.
